ers. This tender tale celebrates love and the joys of spending time with family, no matter what the day brings.","author":"Oge Mora","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/cards/eKrct/PreviewThankYouOmu-1.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"US English","copyright":"© 2018 Oge Mora, © 2019 Oge Mora ℗ 2019 Hachette Audio","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/NvSB-2oGLjbEmCUjEkjqwzyfXul1otU8g9uAITdM9Tk"},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2025-04-01T13:08:42.727Z"},"accents":["US English"],"authors":["Oge Mora"],"copyrights":["© 2018 Oge Mora, © 2019 Oge Mora ℗ 2019 Hachette Audio"],"genres":["families-and-friendship"],"narrators":["LaQuita James & Tracey Leigh"]}}}